      "content": "hey, im a coworker of the person you just talked to. im the systems architect for this org. i took a look at the logs and it looks like we might be dealing with some significant packet loss and maybe some interference on the 2.4GHz band. can you give me a more technical breakdown of how to optimize our channel allocation and if there's any way to troubleshoot the attenuation issues we're seeing in the back rooms?",
